commit setup
  declare relation state
  declare relation cleared
  declare relation has
  declare relation yields

  hall/great `cleared` mark/yes
  watch/keeper `state` waiting

  way/north `cleared` mark/yes
  way/north `has` draft/cold
  way/north `yields` sound/none

  way/east `cleared` mark/yes
  way/east `has` water/running
  way/east `yields` sound/echo

  way/south `cleared` mark/yes
  way/south `has` rubble/fallen
  way/south `yields` sound/none

  way/west `cleared` mark/yes
  way/west `has` light/daylight
  way/west `yields` sound/wind
